license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.14.2
date-released: "2026-10-07"
abstract: >-
  Physics-structured dynamics with a learned causal residual, controlled by constrained optimal
  control and MPC, and hedged on offline confounded data by an explicit pessimism and support
  layer. Includes causal identification of a control-affine residual's control channel from
  confounded logs, sensitivity-aware control under hidden confounding, a pointwise control-barrier
  audit under a partially identified effect, and results at the causal/control seam whose algebraic
  cores are machine-checked in Rocq.
keywords:
  - causal inference
  - optimal control
  - model predictive control
  - system identification
  - scientific machine learning
  - hybrid models
  - offline reinforcement learning
  - jax
